--------------------------------------------------
Table full name: FDA.FDIC_BANKS.INSTITUTIONS
Column name: office_count_foreign Type: NUMBER Description: The number of foreign offices (outside the U.S.) operated by the institution.
Column name: office_count_domestic Type: NUMBER Description: The number of domestic offices (including headquarters) operated by active institutions in the 50 states of the U.S.A.
Column name: office_count_us_territories Type: NUMBER Description: The number of offices operated by an FDIC-insured institution in all commonwealths and terrirtories of the US, along with those in freely associated states under the Compact of Free Association
Column name: zip_code Type: TEXT Description: The first three, four, or five digits of the full postal zip code representing physical location of the institution or its branch office.
Sample rows:
[{'zip_code': '36067', 'office_count_domestic': None, 'office_count_foreign': None, 'office_count_us_territories': None}, {'zip_code': '36567', 'office_count_domestic': None, 'office_count_foreign': None, 'office_count_us_territories': None}, {'zip_code': '36542', 'office_count_domestic': None, 'office_count_foreign': None, 'office_count_us_territories': None}, {'zip_code': '36027', 'office_count_domestic': None, 'office_count_foreign': None, 'office_count_us_territories': None}, {'zip_code': '36037', 'office_count_domestic': None, 'office_count_foreign': None, 'office_count_us_territories': None}]

--------------------------------------------------
Table full name: FDA.FDIC_BANKS.LOCATIONS
Column name: zip_code Type: TEXT Description: The first five digits of the full postal zip code representing physical location of the branch.
Column name: state Type: TEXT Description: State abbreviation in which the branch is physically located. The FDIC Act defines state as any State of the United States, the District of Columbia, and any territory of the United States, Puerto Rico, Guam, American Samoa, the Trust Territory of the Pacific Islands, the Virgin Island, and the Northern Mariana Islands.
Column name: branch_name Type: TEXT Description: Name of the branch.
Sample rows:
[{'branch_name': 'CLIO BRANCH', 'zip_code': '36017', 'state': 'AL'}, {'branch_name': 'EUFAULA SQUARE BRANCH', 'zip_code': '36027', 'state': 'AL'}, {'branch_name': 'EUFAULA AVENUE BRANCH', 'zip_code': '36027', 'state': 'AL'}, {'branch_name': 'OXFORD BRANCH', 'zip_code': '36203', 'state': 'AL'}, {'branch_name': 'ANNISTON BRANCH', 'zip_code': '36201', 'state': 'AL'}]

